{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-deet-science2-33","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"physics","number":33,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-electro","unitLabel":"전기·자기","topic":"전류·전압·저항","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-electro"],"stem":"그림은전지, 축전기, 스위치, 저항R 1과R 2로구성된회로를\n나타낸것이다. 스위치를닫아충분한시간동안축전기를\n충전시킨후, 다시스위치를열어방전시킨다.\n이과정에대한<보기>의설명중옳은것을모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 축전기가충전되는동안R 1에흐르는전류는증가한다.\nㄴ. 축전기가충전되는동안R 2에걸리는전압은증가한다.\nㄷ. 완전히충전된축전기양단의전압은R 1에걸리는전압과\n같다.\nㄹ. 축전기가방전되는동안R 2에걸리는전압은감소한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":547,"height":238,"region":0,"bbox":[49.311,71.725,218.8,95.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-deet-science2-33/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":308,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,213.725,297.6,123.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-deet-science2-33/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[373.089,67.475,690.55,452.162],"width":317.462,"height":384.687,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[49.311,71.725,218.8,95.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.111,213.725,297.6,123.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"33. 그림은전지, 축전기, 스위치, 저항R 1과R 2로구성된회로를","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.387,12.567],"spans":[{"text":"33.","bbox":[5.0,5.12,12.99,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.945],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T10"},{"t